  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre TF-40 315 16M V3 is the most stable spin-friendly model in the TF-40 lineup. Featuring a 98 sq.in head, 315 g unstrung weight and a center-tight 16x19 string pattern, it combines exceptional stability with modern spin potential. RS Sharp Section geometry preserves directional precision, the polyurethane foam-filled frame delivers a solid and comfortable impact feel, and Extense BG grommets improve string movement and responsiveness on off-center shots. It is designed for advanced competitors who want maximum stability without sacrificing spin.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre TF-40 315 16M V3 是 TF-40 系列中兼具最高稳定性与现代旋转能力的版本。采用98平方英寸拍面、315克空拍重量及16×19线床，在保持扎实击球感的同时，比18×20版本更容易制造旋转。RS Sharp Section 拍框结构优化击球轨迹控制；整支拍框内部填充聚氨酯泡沫，带来优秀的减震表现与扎实手感；Extense BG 加宽线孔则提高球线活动空间，使非甜区击球依然保持稳定反馈。这是一支适合高水平竞技球员、强调稳定击球与旋转兼顾的现代控制型球拍。"
  },

